, Welcome Week","notes":"Join the soccer-season spirit event for music, food, games, prizes, and Rambler support; check Welcome Week for the year’s details.","short_summary":"Loyola’s soccer-focused spirit tradition.","evidence_claim":"Loyola’s student-life materials list Hustle to Hoyne among its campus traditions and describe it as a soccer spirit event.","source_url":"https://www.luc.edu/media/lucedu/enrollmentmarketing/pdfs/undergrad/2025/250923_UAO_Student%20Life%20Mailer_f_SPREADS.pdf","source_title":"Love Where You Learn: Loyola University Chicago Student Life Mailer","source_kind":"university_official","source_published_at":"2025-09-23","source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":null,"access_notes":"Loyola’s 2025 Welcome Week schedule placed Hustle to Hoyne at Loyola Soccer Park; verify current programming.","cost_status":"unknown","under21_safe":true},{"subject_id":"loyola-jesuit-jam","subject_type":"tradition","entity_name":"Jesuit Jam","title":"Meet the Jesuits at Jesuit Jam","subtitle":"Damen Student Center and Gentile Arena","notes":"Attend the pre-game celebration with Loyola’s Jesuit community, then cheer during the associated Rambler basketball game if you have a ticket.","short_summary":"A nearly 25-year pre-game tradition connecting students, Jesuits, and basketball.","evidence_claim":"Loyola calls Jesuit Jam a beloved annual celebration and reported it as a nearly 25-year-old pre-game tradition.","source_url":"https://www.luc.edu/studentdevelopment/opportunities/jesuitjam/","source_title":"Jesuit Jam","source_kind":"university_official","source_published_at":"2026-01-27","source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":null,"access_notes":"Loyola lists the pre-game celebration as free and open to all; basketball-game tickets are separately required.","cost_status":"free","under21_safe":true},{"subject_id":"loyola-midnight-bike-ride","subject_type":"tradition","entity_name":"Midnight Bik